    <briefdescription>
<para>A class that represents two vectorization factors (initialized with 0 by default). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One for fixed-width vectorization and one for scalable vectorization. This can be used by the vectorizer to choose from a range of fixed and/or scalable VFs in order to find the most cost-effective VF to vectorize with. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
